    {
      "source": "A Java <code>Optional</code> or Guava <code>Optional</code>. Expects the query method to return one result at most. If no result is found, <code>Optional.empty()</code> or <code>Optional.absent()</code> is returned. More than one result triggers an <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>.",
      "translation": "Java 的 `Optional` 或 Guava 的 `Optional`。期望查询方法最多返回一个结果。如果未找到结果，则返回 `Optional.empty()` 或 `Optional.absent()`。若返回多个结果，则会抛出 `IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException` 异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Types that expose a constructor or <code>….of(…)</code>/<code>….valueOf(…)</code> factory method taking a <code>Streamable</code> as argument. See <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.collections-and-iterables.streamable-wrapper\">Returning Custom Streamable Wrapper Types</a> for details.",
      "translation": "暴露构造函数或接受<code>Streamable</code>作为参数的<code>….of(…)</code>/<code>….valueOf(…)</code>工厂方法的类型。有关详细信息，请参阅<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.collections-and-iterables.streamable-wrapper\">返回自定义 Streamable 包装器类型</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>Window</code> of results obtained from a scroll query. Provides <code>ScrollPosition</code> to issue the next scroll query. Requires a <code>ScrollPosition</code> method parameter.",
      "translation": "一个从滚动查询中获取结果的<code>Window</code>。提供<code>ScrollPosition</code>以发出下一个滚动查询。需要一个<code>ScrollPosition</code>方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A Project Reactor <code>Mono</code> emitting zero or one element using reactive repositories. Expects the query method to return one result at most. If no result is found, <code>Mono.empty()</code> is returned. More than one result triggers an <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>.",
      "translation": "使用响应式仓库发射零个或一个元素的 Project Reactor <code>Mono</code>。预期查询方法最多返回一个结果；若未找到结果，则返回 <code>Mono.empty()</code>；若有多个结果，则会触发 <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A RxJava <code>Single</code> emitting a single element using reactive repositories. Expects the query method to return one result at most. If no result is found, an error signal (e.g. <code>EmptyResultDataAccessException</code>) is emitted. More than one result triggers an <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>.",
      "translation": "使用响应式仓储发出单个元素的 RxJava <code>Single</code>。期望查询方法最多返回一个结果。如果未找到结果，则发出错误信号（例如 <code>EmptyResultDataAccessException</code>）。如果返回多于一个结果，则会触发 <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A RxJava <code>Maybe</code> emitting zero or one element using reactive repositories. Expects the query method to return one result at most. If no result is found, <code>Maybe.empty()</code> is returned. More than one result triggers an <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>.",
      "translation": "使用响应式仓储的 RxJava `Maybe`，最多发射一个元素。预期查询方法返回的结果不超过一条。若未找到结果，则返回 `Maybe.empty()`；若发现多条结果，则会触发 `IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A unique entity. Expects the query method to return one result at most. If no result is found, <code>null</code> is returned. More than one result triggers an <code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>.",
      "translation": "这是一个独特的实体。期望查询方法最多返回一个结果；如果未找到任何结果，则返回<code>null</code>；若返回多于一个结果，则会触发<code>IncorrectResultSizeDataAccessException</code>异常。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Either a Scala or Vavr <code>Option</code> type. Semantically the same behavior as Java’s <code>Optional</code>, described earlier.",
      "translation": "Scala 或 Vavr 的 `<code>Option</code>` 类型。其语义行为与前述 Java 的 `<code>Optional</code>` 相同。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Types that implement <code>Streamable</code> and take a <code>Streamable</code> constructor or factory method argument",
      "translation": "实现了 `<code>Streamable</code>` 接口并采用 `<code>Streamable</code>` 构造函数或工厂方法参数的类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>Future</code>. Expects a method to be annotated with <code>@Async</code> and requires Spring’s asynchronous method execution capability to be enabled.",
      "translation": "<code>Future</code>。期望方法已使用 <code>@Async</code> 注解，并且需要启用 Spring 的异步方法执行功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>CompletableFuture</code>. Expects a method to be annotated with <code>@Async</code> and requires Spring’s asynchronous method execution capability to be enabled.",
      "translation": "一个<code>CompletableFuture</code>。期望方法上标注了<code>@Async</code>，并且需要启用 Spring 的异步方法执行功能。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>Slice</code> with additional information, such as the total number of results. Requires a <code>Pageable</code> method parameter.",
      "translation": "包含额外信息（如结果总数）的<code>Slice</code>。需要一个<code>Pageable</code>方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>Page</code> with <code>GeoResult&lt;T&gt;</code>, such as the average distance to a reference location.",
      "translation": "包含<code>GeoResult&lt;T&gt;</code>的<code>Page</code>，例如到参考位置的平均距离。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A Project Reactor <code>Flux</code> emitting zero, one, or many elements using reactive repositories. Queries returning <code>Flux</code> can emit also an infinite number of elements.",
      "translation": "使用响应式仓库发射零个、一个或多个元素的 Project Reactor <code>Flux</code>。返回 <code>Flux</code> 的查询也可能发射无限数量的元素。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A RxJava <code>Flowable</code> emitting zero, one, or many elements using reactive repositories. Queries returning <code>Flowable</code> can emit also an infinite number of elements.",
      "translation": "使用响应式仓库发射零个、一个或多个元素的 RxJava <code>Flowable</code>。返回 <code>Flowable</code> 的查询也可以发射无限数量的元素。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A Java <code>Stream</code>.",
      "translation": "Java 的 `<code>Stream`。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A convenience extension of <code>Iterable</code> that directly exposes methods to stream, map and filter results, concatenate them etc.",
      "translation": "一个对 `Iterable` 的便捷扩展，直接暴露用于流式处理、映射和过滤结果以及连接它们等方法。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Vavr collection types. See <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.collections-and-iterables.vavr\">Support for Vavr Collections</a> for details.",
      "translation": "Vavr 集合类型。有关详细信息，请参阅<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"query-methods-details.html#repositories.collections-and-iterables.vavr\">对 Vavr 集合的支持</a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A sized chunk of data with an indication of whether there is more data available. Requires a <code>Pageable</code> method parameter.",
      "translation": "一个带有指示是否还有更多可用数据标记的数据块。需要一个 `<code>Pageable</code>` 方法参数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A list of <code>GeoResult&lt;T&gt;</code> with additional information, such as the average distance to a reference location.",
      "translation": "包含额外信息（例如到参考位置的平均距离）的<code>GeoResult&lt;T&gt;</code>列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A list of <code>SearchResult&lt;T&gt;</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>SearchResult&lt;T&gt;</code> 的列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The following table lists the return types generally supported by Spring Data repositories.\nHowever, consult the store-specific documentation for the exact list of supported return types, because some types listed here might not be supported in a particular store.",
      "translation": "下表列出了 Spring Data 仓库通常支持的返回类型。  \n然而，请查阅特定存储器的文档以获取确切的受支持返回类型列表，因为此处列出的一些类型可能在特定的存储器中不受支持。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Denotes no return value.",
      "translation": "表示无返回值。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Java primitives.",
      "translation": "Java 基本数据类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Wrapper types",
      "translation": "包装类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Java wrapper types.",
      "translation": "Java 包装类型。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A result entry with additional information, such as the distance to a reference location.",
      "translation": "包含附加信息（例如到参考位置的距离）的结果条目。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A result entry with additional information, such as the score in relation to the reference search term.",
      "translation": "包含额外信息的结果条目，例如与参考搜索词相关的得分。",
      "count": 1
    },
